  "body": "Introducing 11a The Terrace, Takapuna - a boutique architecturally designed freehold residence,  created for those who appreciate refined design, premium craftsmanship, and an unbeatable coastal lifestyle.  Desirable north western position of the development with lovely afternoon sun. Three divine ensuited bedrooms offering fantastic separation and privacy. Suits families and multi generational situations perfectly.  \r\n\r\nRarely does a development of this calibre become available in such a tightly held central Takapuna location. Striking LED lighting features creating a glamorous feel. \r\n\r\nPositioned on one of Takapuna's most central, accessible streets, this brand-new residence combines bold contemporary architecture with carefully curated interiors that stand confidently apart from the ordinary. From striking colour palettes to artistic bathroom detailing, and this home has been thoughtfully designed to bring personality, warmth, and sophistication into everyday living.\r\n\r\nSpanning three beautifully appointed levels, this residence offers an intelligent and highly functional layout:\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a single garage and a versatile lounge that could also serve as an ensuite bedroom, ideal for guests, extended family or a private work-from-home space. The middle level offers expansive open-plan living and dining alongside a designer kitchen, while upstairs are two luxurious master suites with Rangitoto and sea views. With internal-access garaging, excellent storage throughout and space to install a lift connecting all three floors, this home is designed for comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home, the designer kitchen is crafted to impress, featuring premium Miele appliances, integrated fridge solutions, and refined cabinetry seamlessly blended into the architectural aesthetic. Clean lines, high-end finishes, and exceptional attention to detail create a level of sophistication rarely seen in today's townhouse market.\r\n\r\nUnlike many new developments, 11 The Terrace offers the freedom and convenience of freehold titles with no body corporate fees - a truly rare opportunity in central Takapuna.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Takapuna Beach, Shore City Shopping Centre, vibrant cafés, award-winning restaurants, and everyday amenities, the lifestyle on offer here is second to none. Enjoy the perfect balance of coastal relaxation and urban convenience, all within easy reach of Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nBuilt for long-term peace of mind, 11a is backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nBoutique developments of this scale, quality, and location are becoming increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a home.\r\nThis is statement living.\r\nThis is Takapuna at its finest.\r\nView with Alison Parker at New Zealand International Sotheby's Realty today, phone or text 021983533",
